    "text": "Relative stability of radicals :<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#8729;</mo></mover><mfenced><mi>sp</mi></mfenced></munder><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>CH</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><munder><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#8729;</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mfenced><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced></munder><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><munder><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#8729;</mo></mover><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>Ph</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>Resonance</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>stabilized</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></munder><mo>&#62;</mo><munder><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#8729;</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mfenced><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced></munder></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>BDE</mi></math></p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>CH</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>CH</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>Ph</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>CH</mi><msub><mfenced><msub>